157
00:12:26,150 --> 00:12:33,810
So what is this ni nj?

158
00:12:33,810 --> 00:12:38,570
I claim this thing
is 1/3 delta ij.

159
00:12:42,830 --> 00:12:45,020
And it's based on
the following idea,

160
00:12:45,020 --> 00:12:49,670
