194
00:14:44,590 --> 00:14:48,810
So with this number, the
whole formula is now finished.

195
00:14:48,810 --> 00:14:50,010
This is the final form.

196
00:14:52,890 --> 00:14:55,680
The rate for
spontaneous transition

197
00:14:55,680 --> 00:15:00,690
